@herbertong @CernBasher Macroharder and Minihard both have 220k GB300s with 800 gig nics configured for training. Gun Range will have the same. Spam (used to house Hormel products) will have ~200k GB300s, but configured for inference, so much simpler networking and less than half the fiber. 

I walked the whole Colossus 2 site around midnight and again this morning. 

Good progress by the SpaceX team and contractors. Gun Range is tracking to be operational by end of November and Spam in December.

